caption: True Anatomy
tradition-component: true-anatomy

If a Spawn trait could theoretically exist as an intrinsic mundane biological or anatomical trait, the Spawn Master may instead buy off the Eldritch source modifier entirely. The test is whether the trait's actual function could be produced by a body part, organ, tissue, natural weapon, sense, locomotor structure, armor, or other biology without requiring a supernatural principle. It need not be realistic for the character's original Species. Extra Arms, tentacles, claws, teeth, ordinary enhanced senses, biological DR, gills, and winged Flight are examples of traits that can qualify. Telekinesis, Warp, extradimensional internal space, supernatural mind control, and similar impossible functions do not qualify merely because they have an anatomical special effect.

A trait that becomes True Anatomy is no longer a supernatural ability for countermeasure purposes. Subtle may retain Switchable, Linked, Reduced Time or other Takes Less Time construction, Reflexive, and other already-purchased Path modifiers. Metamorphic may retain Only While in [Specific Alternate Form]. These modifiers remain fully point-paid. True Anatomy changes the source of the trait, not its other construction.
